WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.250 --> 00:00:02.503
THOR
How are we doing, guys?

00:00:03.992 --> 00:00:05.214
DRAX
We're all about to die!

00:00:05.375 --> 00:00:07.481
ROCKET
You said this would be a relaxing holiday!

00:00:07.531 --> 00:00:08.507
NEBULA
[Screaming]

00:00:08.593 --> 00:00:09.606
THOR
I said it was going to be

00:00:09.656 --> 00:00:11.390
"like" a relaxing holiday.

00:00:13.008 --> 00:00:14.097
Times like this...

00:00:14.531 --> 00:00:15.482
...we need to come together.

00:00:15.914 --> 00:00:16.727
JANE FOSTER
Quite a reunion, huh?

00:00:20.195 --> 00:00:21.655
THOR
What a classic Thor adventure!

00:00:22.422 --> 00:00:23.148
ZEUS
Flick!

00:00:23.250 --> 00:00:24.403
[Crowd gasping]

00:00:24.453 --> 00:00:25.710
THOR
Okay, we should go.

